  m_Name: PlaceTower
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: TowerDefence.Battlefield::TowerDefence.Battlefield.TutorialDefinition
  Id: PlaceTower
  Title: How to place a tower
  Pages:
  - Select a structure, point at a valid green cell, and review its preview. Rotate
    if needed, then Confirm. Cancel does not spend Money.
  - Navy towers need an empty compatible foundation. In physical mode use your ray;
    in commander mode point at the live map. Both operate on the same structures.
